  dialogueLines:
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: Well, it was fun doing this adventure with you. \nI hope we will work together
      in the future.
    tags: 
  - speakerName: PIP
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3e4ff024cd09fad41a6f1af4bf8b77be, type: 3}
    text: I don't know, you have to tell me. \nYou built me, remember?
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: Right. See yah, my little friend :) until we meet again!
    tags: 
